The Windows-1252 mapping in opennlp.tools.artifacts.CursorArtifactDetector
is derived from CP1252.TXT (table version 2.01, 1998-04-15):
https://www.unicode.org/Public/MAPPINGS/VENDORS/MICSFT/WINDOWS/CP1252.TXT

